<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Ettington half year shr falls, div up.</title>
<headline>Ettington half year shr falls, div up.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-01-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Half year ended December 31</p>
<p>			(million rand unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr, headline (cts)   13.7	  vs 16.7</p>
<p>    Shr, attrib (cts)     13.7	  vs 218.0</p>
<p>    Div (cts)		 9.3	   vs 8.7</p>
<p>    Attrib income	   4.47	  vs 60.19</p>
<p>    Pre-tax		   5.29	  vs 5.65</p>
<p>    Tax			 0.83	  vs 1.05</p>
<p>Income:</p>
<p>    - dividends	     3.05	  vs 2.84</p>
<p>    - interest		2.30	  vs 2.86</p>
<p>    Surplus on disposals   -	    vs 55.59</p>
<p>Div payable January 31</p>
<p>on register January 10</p>
<p>Full name: Ettington Investments Ltd (investment trust)</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
